      "widgets_values": [
        "## Flux img2img subtle denoise 0.35 (lab)\n\nWhat this graph does: Light polish of ComfyUI's default **example.png** doodle (denoise 0.35). Sketch→cleaner sketch.\nModels: flux-2-klein-9b-nvfp4 + qwen_3_8b_fp4mixed (CLIP type flux2) + flux2-vae.\nSampler: euler · simple · CFG 1.0 · 8 steps · denoise 0.35.\nSaveImage prefix: ez_flux_img2img_subtle.\nDefault LoadImage: **example.png** (pink dress / yellow wing-hair stick figure).\n\nDemo thesis: keep the crude doodle's layout; only tidy it. Positive must name dress, hair, hill, sky.\n\nPrompting (Flux.2 Klein + Qwen3 TE):\n• Natural-language prose; subject first. Name sketch shapes so the model does not invent a new scene.\n• At CFG 1.0 the Negative node is largely inert; Positive carries quality.\n\nHow to run:\n1. Leave LoadImage on example.png (or swap your own sketch).\n2. Queue; compare subtle polish vs medium/strong graphs."
      ],
      "title": "Flux img2img subtle denoise 0.35 (lab) — operator note"
    }
